{"id":"leetcode-2446","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"Determine if Two Events Have Conflict","summary":"Given two events defined by their start and end times in 24-hour format, determine if they overlap by checking for any shared moment.","statement":"Given two events defined by their start and end times in 24-hour format, determine if they overlap by checking for any shared moment. Return true if they conflict, otherwise return false.","constraints":["Each event is [start,end] in 24-hour HH:MM format.","Both endpoints are included.","Return whether the two events share at least one minute."],"topics":["strings","intervals"],"prerequisites":[],"signature":{"name":"events_conflict","parameters":[{"name":"event1","annotation":"list[str]","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null},{"name":"event2","annotation":"list[str]","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"bool","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def events_conflict(event1: list[str], event2: list[str]) -> bool:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def events_conflict(event1,event2):\n    return max(event1[0],event2[0])<=min(event1[1],event2[1])\n","brute_force_solution":null,"known_wrong_solutions":["def events_conflict(event1,event2):\n    return max(event1[0],event2[0])<min(event1[1],event2[1])\n","def events_conflict(event1,event2):\n    return min(event1[0],event2[0])<=min(event1[1],event2[1])\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(1)","target_space_complexity":"O(1)","estimated_minutes":20,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":1,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["Lexicographic order of zero-padded HH:MM strings is chronological order.","An overlap starts at the later start and ends at the earlier end.","Return later_start <= earlier_end because endpoints are inclusive.","Two closed intervals intersect exactly under that inequality."],"editorial":"Two closed intervals intersect exactly under that inequality.","tests":[{"id":"lc-2446-1","arguments":[["01:15","02:00"],["02:00","03:00"]],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":true,"explanation":"The first event ends exactly when the second starts, and inclusive endpoints make that a conflict.","expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-2446-2","arguments":[["10:00","11:00"],["11:01","12:00"]],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":true,"explanation":"The second event begins one minute after the first ends, so they do not overlap.","expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-2446-3","arguments":[["00:00","00:00"],["00:00","00:00"]],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-2446-4","arguments":[["00:00","01:00"],["01:00","02:00"]],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-2446-5","arguments":[["00:00","00:59"],["01:00","02:00"]],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-2446-6","arguments":[["12:00","13:00"],["11:00","12:00"]],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-2446-7","arguments":[["12:00","13:00"],["13:01","14:00"]],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-2446-8","arguments":[["09:30","10:30"],["09:45","10:00"]],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-2446-9","arguments":[["09:45","10:00"],["09:30","10:30"]],"expected":true,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-2446-10","arguments":[["23:00","23:59"],["22:00","22:59"]],"expected":false,"comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-2446-11","arguments":[["05:00","